      "content": "<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;'><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:48px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;color:rgba(248,244,235,0.65);letter-spacing:-0.01em;'>Seu atendimento 24h/7d,</p><p style='font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;font-size:124px;font-weight:800;line-height:0.93;letter-spacing:-0.04em;'><span style='color:#ffffff;'>direto no</span><br><span style='color:#C8FF2E;'>WhatsApp.</span></p><div style='height:2px;background:rgba(248,244,235,0.12);margin:20px 0 8px;'></div><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.45;color:rgba(248,244,235,0.82);'>CitraChat agora com integração nativa<br><span style='color:#E05C3E;font-weight:700;'>Oficial da Meta.</span></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "filename": "slide-02-problema.png",
      "bg": "void",
      "content": "<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;width:100%;'><div class='status-badge'><span class='dot'></span>Nova integração disponível</div><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(248,244,235,0.55);'>Dúvidas, decisões de compra, pedidos de suporte. Boa parte disso chega pelo WhatsApp fora do expediente.</p><p style='font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;font-size:80px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#C8FF2E;'>Às 22h, no sábado,<br>numa decisão de última hora.</p><div style='height:1px;background:rgba(248,244,235,0.12);'></div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;'><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(248,244,235,0.55);'>Sem resposta em minutos, o lead não volta.</p><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;color:#E05C3E;'>Vai pro próximo resultado do Google.</p></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "filename": "slide-03-como-funciona.png",
      "bg": "cream",
      "content": "<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px;width:100%;'><p style='font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;font-size:76px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#13111E;'>Como funciona<br>na prática.</p><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;'><span class='label-pill lime'>Mesmo agente, novo canal</span><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:31px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink2);'>O que você treinou no site responde no WhatsApp.<br>Sem reconfigurar nada.</p></div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;'><span class='label-pill coral'>Setup em minutos</span><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:31px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink2);'>Conecta o número no painel via Embedded Signup.<br>Sem criar conta na Meta, sem configuração técnica.</p></div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;'><span class='label-pill sky'>API Oficial da Meta</span><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:31px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink2);'>Sem gambiarras, sem risco de ban.<br>Integração certificada e estável.</p></div></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "filename": "slide-04-cta.png",
      "bg": "pulse",
      "noLogo": true,
      "noArrow": true,
      "noFooter": true,
      "content": "<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:56px;width:100%;'><p class='h1 ink' style='max-width:820px;'>Seu atendimento no WhatsApp começa agora.</p><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;'><p class='body-md ink' style='opacity:0.45;'>Integração nativa. API Oficial da Meta.</p><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;'><p style='font-family:\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:#13111E;opacity:0.55;letter-spacing:0.04em;'>Saiba mais em:</p><p style='font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;font-size:52px;font-weight:800;color:#13111E;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1;'>citra.chat/whatsapp</p></div></div></div>"
